<title>SINGAPORE: ADNOC issues tender to sell Jul 26-28 diesel.</title>
<headline>ADNOC issues tender to sell Jul 26-28 diesel.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abu Dhabi National Oil Co (ADNOC) has issued a tender to sell 75,000 tonnes of 0.5-percent sulphur gas oil for July 26-28 lifting, free-on-board (fob) Ruwais basis, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on June 25 and bids will be valid for five days.</p>
<p>In its last tender, ADNOC sold 75,000 tonnes of 0.5-percent sulphur gas oil to Malaysia's Petco at a premium of 35 cents per barrel to MidEast spot quotes for June lifting, fob Ruwais basis.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
